      "description": "모둠별 점수를 크게 보여 주고, 1등 모둠을 표시해요.",
      "howToUse": "모둠 수를 정하고 [점수판 만들기]. 모둠 이름을 눌러 바꿀 수 있고 +1·+5·−1 버튼으로 점수를 줘요.",
      "promptRecipe": "모둠 수를 정하면 점수 카드가 생기는 점수판을 만들어 줘. +1, +5, −1 버튼, 모둠 이름 수정, 1등 강조.",
      "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>모둠 점수판</title>\n<style>\n  body { font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 16px; background: #f5f3fb; color: #1f2328; }\n  h1 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 1.4rem; }\n  .row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; align-items: center; margin: 8px 0; }\n  button { font-size: 1.1rem; padding: 8px 14px; border-radius: 10px; border: 0; background: #5b4a8a; color: #fff; cursor: pointer; }\n  #board { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(160px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }\n  .t { background: #fff; border-radius: 16px; padding: 12px; text-align: center; }\n  .t input { font-size: 1.1rem; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; text-align: center; border: 0; border-bottom: 2px solid #ddd; }\n  .s { font-size: 3.5rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 6px 0; }\n  .t.top { outline: 4px solid #e2b33c; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<h1>🏆 모둠 점수판</h1>\n<div class=\"row\">\n  <label>모둠 수 <input type=\"number\" id=\"n\" min=\"2\" max=\"12\" value=\"4\" style=\"width:4em\"></label>\n  <button id=\"make\">점수판 만들기</button>\n  <button id=\"zero\">모두 0점</button>\n</div>\n<div id=\"board\"></div>\n<script>\n  let teams = [];\n  function render() {\n    const max = Math.max(...teams.map((t) => t.score));\n    const board = document.getElementById('board'); board.textContent = '';\n    teams.forEach((t) => {\n      const box = document.createElement('div'); box.className = 't' + (t.score === max && max > 0 ? ' top' : '');\n      const title = document.createElement('input'); title.value = t.label; title.setAttribute('aria-label', '모둠 표시'); title.oninput = (e) => { t.label = e.target.value; };\n      const s = document.createElement('div'); s.className = 's'; s.textContent = t.score;\n      const row = document.createElement('div'); row.className = 'row'; row.style.justifyContent = 'center';\n      [[-1, '−1'], [1, '+1'], [5, '+5']].forEach(([d, label]) => { const b = document.createElement('button'); b.textContent = label; b.onclick = () => { t.score += d; render(); }; row.appendChild(b); });\n      box.append(title, s, row); board.appendChild(box);\n    });\n  }\n  document.getElementById('make').onclick = () => { const n = Math.min(12, Math.max(2, +document.getElementById('n').value || 4)); teams = Array.from({ length: n }, (_, i) => ({ label: (i + 1) + '모둠', score: 0 })); render(); };\n  document.getElementById('zero').onclick = () => { teams.forEach((t) => (t.score = 0)); render(); };\n  document.getElementById('make').click();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
